  "title": "Geneve: Add new GCP options.",
  "description": "Add support for three new GCP-specific options:\n\n- Timestamp (0x0f)\n- Network Stable ID (0x10)\n- Primary IPv4 Address (0x11)\n\nSimilar to https://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/merge_requests/6559\n\nManually verified in a fresh debian container - will attach example pcap and output.\n\nAI-Assisted: no\n\n[example_out.txt](/uploads/37ae4d1e30d1bb23dbaff24ceb875110/example_out.txt)\n\n[example.pcap](/uploads/630f2d9828a0b065a4ad2f11b4475a80/example.pcap)",
